{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 138, "line_no": 3, "text": "请灵经，又叫唤魂经，是古谢中念唱的第四首祭祀词。", "bbox_px": {"x": 247, "y": 534, "w": 951, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "请灵经，又叫唤魂经，是古谢中念唱的第四首祭祀词。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 247, "y": 534, "w": 951, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 138, "line_no": 4, "text": "这首词追述了从人死到升天至唤灵归回的全过程。如同其它首唱", "bbox_px": {"x": 244, "y": 593, "w": 1129, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "这首词追述了从人死到升天至唤灵归回的全过程。如同其它首唱", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 244, "y": 593, "w": 1129, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 138, "line_no": 5, "text": "词一样，它保存了布依族特有的传统习俗和风规。词中，把人死视为", "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 656, "w": 1211, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "词一样，它保存了布依族特有的传统习俗和风规。词中，把人死视为", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 656, "w": 1211, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 138, "line_no": 6, "text": "另辟新路，另走新天地的自然规律，谁也不免一死，死了归同路，新", "bbox_px": {"x": 158, "y": 715, "w": 1215, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "另辟新路，另走新天地的自然规律，谁也不免一死，死了归同路，新", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 158, "y": 715, "w": 1215, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 138, "line_no": 7, "text": "的地方与人间比较，有好过之而无不及，并无什么痛苦可言。死后到", "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 775, "w": 1211, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "的地方与人间比较，有好过之而无不及，并无什么痛苦可言。死后到", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 775, "w": 1211, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 138, "line_no": 8, "text": "天上去，去会天上的神仙（皇帝），会受到很大的宽待。当然从人间到", "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 837, "w": 1211, "h": 50}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "天上去，去会天上的神仙（皇帝），会受到很大的宽待。当然从人间到", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 837, "w": 1211, "h": 50}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 138, "line_no": 9, "text": "天上，从生到死，经过的路是漫长而曲折的，要过若干条路，若干条", "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 897, "w": 1211, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "天上，从生到死，经过的路是漫长而曲折的，要过若干条路，若干条", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 897, "w": 1211, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 138, "line_no": 10, "text": "街，若干田坝，若干坡头，若干层次，还要过河桥（磴磴桥）、铜桥等", "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 956, "w": 1211, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "街，若干田坝，若干坡头，若干层次，还要过河桥（磴磴桥）、铜桥等", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 956, "w": 1211, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 138, "line_no": 11, "text": "等。铜桥一段很有特色。布依族古谢经中唱到“铜”不少，还有铜并", "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 1012, "w": 1211, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "等。铜桥一段很有特色。布依族古谢经中唱到“铜”不少，还有铜并", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 1012, "w": 1211, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 138, "line_no": 12, "text": "等等，对考察布依族铜器时代的历史很有帮助。", "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 1075, "w": 833, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "等等，对考察布依族铜器时代的历史很有帮助。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 161, "y": 1075, "w": 833, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 138, "line_no": 13, "text": "这首经词的层次分明，节奏明晰，语言生动、流畅。在反复的吟", "bbox_px": {"x": 240, "y": 1137, "w": 1132, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "这首经词的层次分明，节奏明晰，语言生动、流畅。在反复的吟", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 240, "y": 1137, "w": 1132, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
